      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 1898 railway line linked Bogotá to the Tequendama Falls area, passing through Puente Aranda and spurring early industrial growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
